0:{"buildId":"EhmNlcVQiTGLRrKh4zA6I","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","div",null,{"className":"sm-mb-50 commonBanner2-module__m8QleG__commonbanner2","style":{"--bg":"url(/_next/static/media/startup-web-banner.1091c0f5.webp) no-repeat center center / cover"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-10 sm-px-20 commonBanner2-module__m8QleG__content","children":[["$","h2",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Website Development Agency in UAE </br>for Technology Startups"}}],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-30","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Empowering tech startups in Dubai & the UAE with high-performance, scalable</br> websites that accelerate growth and attract investors. "}}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/contact-us","className":"blue-btn","children":"Get a Free Consultation"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Startup Website Development UAE"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__flex","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__box","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__gapcontent","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":" <p>The UAE has turned out to be a center of innovation and entrepreneurship, and startups have been gaining ground to such an extent that they are changing entire industries with their novel ideas and disruptive solutions. In an otherwise highly competitive market environment, the influence of having a strong online presence is not just nice to have but it is essential.</p>\n                    <p>The first direct contact with your website is usually the investors, early adopters, and customers. It is the place where they evaluate your vision, innovation, and credibility. A well-designed website defines the personality of your brand, communicates your unique selling point, and instills trust. Investing in a professional website ensures your startup makes a powerful first impression and stands out in the competitive UAE market.</p>\n                    "}}],["$","$L3",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/intro-image-1.a0db40e0.webp","width":1256,"height":664,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"introimg-1"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__box","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/intro-image-2.61d37893.webp","width":1256,"height":664,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"introimg-1"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__gapcontent","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"  <p>Pre-built templates fail to reflect the special features of your startup. These have restricted flexibility, scalability, and performance characteristics which are not even suitable for a growing tech business. The most suitable is a website that is deeply connected with your product, technology, and audience.</p>\n                <p>At <a href='/'>Website Development Agency</a>, we are the best when it comes to building a custom-built website for a technology startup that is a hit with the market and which is innovative. We build engaging and efficient websites that help startups grow and get funding starting from MVP launches to full-scale SaaS platforms. Using our knowledge, the startup stage can turn into a brilliant online presence in no time.</p>\n                    "}}]]}]]}]]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf"],["$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13"],"$L14"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
4:[["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 pt-100 pb-40 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-30 sm-px-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__flex","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__left","children":"Why Startups Need Professional Websites"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__right","children":"For a technology startup, your website is your virtual home base. Thats where you show off your credibility and make a great first impression to investors, partners, and early users. A website made by professionals conveys the idea of trust, the seriousness of the project, and a vision that is clear."}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pb-300 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20 commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__whymetterbg","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/_next/static/media/startup-needs-website.518b630d.webp","alt":"Why Website Development","width":1200,"height":500}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__absolute","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__flex commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__endalign","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__left","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__background","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"  <p>The website of a startup is not just presenting an idea, it is showing the company’s originality and market presence. In the website, you can visualize MVPs, upcoming features, and product roadmaps in a more appealing way. Besides, you can also indicate your technology stack, innovation journey, and unique differentiators that revolutionize your product.</p>\n                        <p>Using the mobile-first design concept your startup can target the people who are always on the move and who use mobile devices, and also you can integrate your startup with your apps or SaaS tools. Every detail, from UI design to the functionality, is specially designed for you to be able to scale at a high rate and do your real-world testing.</p>\n                        "}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__right","children":["$","p",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Website Development Agency provides technology startups in the UAE with expertly crafted websites that combine sleek design, robust functionality, and scalable architecture. We understand the unique needs of startups and build platforms that not only showcase your innovation but also support growth, user engagement, and investor confidence.</p>\n                            "}}]}]]}]}]]}]]
5:["$","$L15",null,{"heading":"Tech Startup Website Template & Custom Designs","description":"Explore flexible website solutions for tech startups or choose a custom-built platform tailored to your product vision. We create startup websites that support performance, user engagement, and rapid business growth.","portfolioData":[{"subtitle":"Tech Startup Website","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/tech-startup-1.90c082f0.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 6,000"},{"subtitle":"Tech Startup Landing Page","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/tech-startup-2.8fabf931.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRswAAABXRUJQVlA4TL8AAAAvBMABAM1VICICHgiwCQAAAIBvdMUlAQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEEWF8wIAAPBAyGEYAAAAzv9+CgAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAGgXDwQcBQAAAOD8b3sIAQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIqS0yMOhq1bYKUpSRp5ic+Sx3r3/thtC+nWPf1Qr8BknyYQgFol4XwDHxCPig5lVWrAA="},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 6,000"},{"subtitle":"Startup MVP Website","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/tech-startup-3.995c5c8d.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 6,000"},{"subtitle":"AI Startup Website","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/tech-startup-4.0d88d4d6.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRtAAAABXRUJQVlA4TMQAAAAvBMABAM1VICICHghADQQAAICL2vwbgwEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgOHB875VBQAA8EAIagAAAADO//YBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAApt4DAUmBAAAAOP/ZFvcBAQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQEAhz22kQ+lHR5OkN/WwIolEjJm6hATofXtWMFBejTv5BNQ30/IZAxrde9ffkT6QC7Rr3p8B"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 6,000"},{"subtitle":"Fintech Startup Website","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/tech-startup-5.0b4ecaf7.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 6,000"},{"subtitle":"Soaftware Startup Website","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/tech-startup-6.2237bbb7.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 6,000"}]}]
6:["$","$L16",null,{"heding":"Our Technology Startup Website Services","subheding":"Website Development Agency appreciates the ordeal that the startups are going through, from the limited time span to the rapid changes in direction. Our tailored website development services form the backbone of your growth journey at every stage.","services":[{"title":"Custom Website Design","desc":"Our aim is to bring about the clean, modern, and UX-driven layout designs that indicate your brand identity, where your website will not only look fresh but also trustworthy.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/startup-web-design.0ffcaaa8.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Custom Startup Website Design Services for Startups- Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Landing Pages & Product Showcases","desc":"Powerful landing pages can create the right engagement for visitors, by which you can rush your features, pricing, and the availability of the product.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/landing-page-creation.b105d5e7.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Landing Page Creation Services for Startups - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Interactive Prototypes & MVP Sites","desc":"Be free to put the first versions to the test by involving the users and getting their feedback, thus making a solid ground for your business idea within a short period of time.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/prototyping-mvp.827e8562.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"MVP Website Development Services for Startups - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"App & SaaS Integrations","desc":"Our services include connecting many necessary attributes like APIs, payment gateways, and other integrations that contribute to the smooth running of your SaaS or tech ecosystem with your website.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/saas-integration.ed13bcab.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"SaaS Integration Services for Startup Websites - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Lead Capture & CRM Integration","desc":"Create a strong base of early adopters, investors, and partners through user-friendly lead forms and automatically connected CRMs.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/crom-inte.93f49cf4.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Lead Capture & CRM Integration Services for Startups - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Responsive Web Design","desc":"Give users the same outstanding experience on all devices, thereby increasing the time they spend on their mobile, tablet, or desktop.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/responsive-web-desi.3fe72211.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Responsive Web Design Services for Startups - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Analytics & Growth Tracking","desc":"Utilize the integrated analytics tools to track user behavior, conversion funnels, and engagement which in turn will be your scaling strategy.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/analytics-tracking.cc06f1a0.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Analytics & Growth Tracking Services for Startup Websites - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Maintenance & Support","desc":"We are always ensuring that your startup’s online face keeps up with your product’s face in the market - by giving continuous maintenance, performance optimization, and feature updates.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/support-maintenance-ser.5933eb3b.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Startup Website Maintenance & Support Services - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"}]}]
